y-allocated lists: NULL head, empty/single/multi-node lists, sorted ascending and descending, all-negative, `INT_MIN`/`INT_MAX` boundaries, all-equal values, 2000 randomized lists up to length 50, and one 100,000-node list. **All 2015+ cases returned byte-identical values** (`fails=0`).\n\n`c_src/` is unmodified — `find c_src -type f -newermt ...` returns 0 changed files."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":530,"cache_read_input_tokens":23209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":530,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ddd010cd-ea3c-49a7-931b-5468aeb4297b","uuid":"4fb936b7-f987-4faf-ad37-f2239813bedf","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:35:52.297Z"}
